			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Guide\n\nIf you go into the [[Commissary.canvas|Commissary]] and have the Magnifying Lens item, you can read one of the notes attached on the wall to discover the password used on the computer terminals in [[024 - Office.canvas|024 - Office]], [[036 - Laboratory.canvas|036 - Laboratory]], [[Shelter.canvas|Shelter]], [[034 - Security.canvas|034 - Security]] rooms.\n\nThe password is **swansong**.",
